regress\artifacts\alphapfnoffset\codex_reachability_20260907.txt:2093:I found a second defect in the hinge: `swpctx` loads the new PTBR, then overwrites it with the PCB flags. The VM abort is also confined to the bootstrap arm. I’m checking machine registration and the memory fast paths before drawing a reachability or severity conclusion.
