regress/alpha_pfnoffset_probe.py:172:#  ---- setup: tables, data and the PCB, ALL planted while ptbr is still 0 ----------------------
regress/alpha_pfnoffset_probe.py:173:#  K0SEG for the data page (trap 4); the table pages are equally reachable either way.
regress/alpha_pfnoffset_probe.py:185:    #  PCB: ptbr AND flags both the L1 PFN, so the swpctx defect cannot change what gets armed.
